WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.066
Nobody moved a muscle.

2
00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:05.790
Even Gub-Gub stopped crying.

3
00:00:05.791 --> 00:00:08.951
Two large bodies walked out of the trees.

4
00:00:08.952 --> 00:00:17.416
Suddenly, Chee-Chee let out a scream.

5
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:20.258
Chee-Chee was speaking very fast.

6
00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:24.244
"What's he saying, Polynesia?" Dr. Dolittle asked.

7
00:00:24.245 --> 00:00:26.373
"It's the language of the monkeys.

8
00:00:26.374 --> 00:00:30.483
I don't understand it," Polynesia shook her head.

9
00:00:30.484 --> 00:00:34.905
Chee-Chee walked back with two big monkeys.

10
00:00:34.906 --> 00:00:38.206
"Do not be afraid," one of them said.

11
00:00:38.207 --> 00:00:41.795
"We've come for Dr. Dolittle," the other said.

12
00:00:41.796 --> 00:00:43.866
"It's an honor to meet you."

13
00:00:43.867 --> 00:00:45.777
"I'm honored as well."

14
00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:49.942
The doctor also beat his chest.

15
00:00:49.943 --> 00:00:52.736
Suddenly the trees began moving again.

16
00:00:52.737 --> 00:00:56.523
This time, a whole army of monkeys walked out.

17
00:00:56.524 --> 00:01:00.225
"Oh, there are so many!" cried Gub-Gub.

18
00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:05.176
Together the monkeys started to beat their chests.

19
00:01:05.177 --> 00:01:10.915
"The Land of the Monkeys welcomes you, Dr. Dolittle," Chee-Chee explained.

20
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:14.729
Meanwhile, the king's guards heard the monkeys.

21
00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:19.903
"This time they will not escape," the leader of the guards smiled.

22
00:01:19.904 --> 00:01:24.750
No one saw the guards coming toward them.

23
00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:28.833
"We're almost there," said a very large monkey.

24
00:01:28.834 --> 00:01:32.526
"Why is it so far?" whined Gub-Gub.

25
00:01:32.527 --> 00:01:34.626
"Do not worry, my pink friend.

26
00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:38.836
I will carry you," the large monkey said.

27
00:01:38.837 --> 00:01:43.510
At that moment, the king's guards ran out from behind.

28
00:01:43.511 --> 00:01:48.045
"We got you now, prisoner!" shouted the leader.

29
00:01:48.046 --> 00:01:51.707
"It's Jolliginki's guards!" yelled a monkey.

30
00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:55.632
"Quickly! To the river!" cried out another.

31
00:01:55.633 --> 00:02:00.613
But all the humans heard was this, "Uga boong-ga goog-ga gu!"

32
00:02:00.614 --> 00:02:03.562
"Yuk! Hoong-ga!"

33
00:02:03.563 --> 00:02:07.363
Dr. Dolittle was not as fast as the animals.

34
00:02:07.364 --> 00:02:10.308
"Dr. Dolittle!" barked Jip.

35
00:02:10.309 --> 00:02:15.606
"Ah-ha! You're mine now, medicine man!" the leader laughed.

36
00:02:15.607 --> 00:02:22.034
Like a bolt of lightning, Jip jumped over and stood in front of Dr. Dolittle.

37
00:02:22.035 --> 00:02:25.932
Jip would not let anyone harm his beloved master.

38
00:02:25.933 --> 00:02:30.353
The king's guard lifted his spear and pointed it at Jip.

39
00:02:30.354 --> 00:02:34.450
Dr. Dolittle shouted for his dog to get away.

40
00:02:34.451 --> 00:02:42.993
Suddenly from the sky, a coconut fell on top of the leader’s head and then he collapsed on the ground.

41
00:02:42.994 --> 00:02:47.038
The Land of the Monkeys was just across the river.

42
00:02:47.039 --> 00:02:51.092
"We need to cross this river," Chee-Chee pointed.

43
00:02:51.093 --> 00:02:54.474
"But how?" Dab-Dab spoke up.

44
00:02:54.475 --> 00:02:56.460
"Oh, they're getting close!

45
00:02:56.461 --> 00:02:59.644
I can hear them!" Gub-Gub cried.

46
00:02:59.645 --> 00:03:04.066
The guards' voices echoed from the trees.

47
00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:09.225
"There is only one way," said the monkey carrying Gub-Gub.

48
00:03:09.226 --> 00:03:11.965
"Come on, boys! Let's make a bridge!"

49
00:03:11.966 --> 00:03:17.005
"Bridge? How are they going to make a bridge?" wondered Dr. Dolittle.

50
00:03:17.006 --> 00:03:19.308
He stared in surprise.

51
00:03:19.309 --> 00:03:24.300
One by one, the monkeys linked their arms and legs together.

52
00:03:24.301 --> 00:03:30.232
They made a bridge of monkeys.

53
00:03:30.233 --> 00:03:33.903
"What?" Dr. Dolittle rubbed his eyes.

54
00:03:33.904 --> 00:03:36.473
"Quickly! Dr. Dolittle, walk over!

55
00:03:36.474 --> 00:03:39.018
Hurry!" shouted a monkey.

56
00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:42.158
Dr. Dolittle crossed to the other side.

57
00:03:42.159 --> 00:03:47.643
The others followed quickly after him.

58
00:03:47.644 --> 00:03:50.686
Gub-Gub was the last one to cross.

59
00:03:50.687 --> 00:03:54.059
He cried but he carefully made it across.

60
00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:58.704
One by one, the monkeys unlinked their arms and legs.

61
00:03:58.705 --> 00:04:01.541
The bridge of monkeys was no more.

62
00:04:01.542 --> 00:04:07.601
"You are the only man ever to see the bridge of monkeys, Doctor," said Chee-Chee.

63
00:04:07.602 --> 00:04:13.873
Dr. Dolittle felt very proud.

